OL,3,GNEWSAUnmasking the gangs 'stealing
OL,4,Amillions' from UK shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has been given special access
OL,7,Fto a police unit that says it has been
OL,8,Fdisrupting organised crime gangs
OL,9,Fresponsible for stealing millions of
OL,10,Fpounds worth of goods from shops across
OL,11,Fthe UK.
OL,13,FThe organised retail crime (ORC) team
OL,14,Fwithin Opal, a national police
OL,15,Fintelligence unit, was set up two years
OL,16,Fago and works with retailers and local
OL,17,Fpolice forces to target criminals
OL,18,Fresponsible for raids across multiple
OL,19,Fstores around Britain.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
