OL,3,GNEWSAUnmasking the gangs 'stealing
OL,4,Amillions' from UK shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was launched after a surge in shop
OL,7,Ftheft that peaked in 2025 with more
OL,8,Fthan half a million offences recorded
OL,9,Fin a year.
OL,11,FThe Home Office said shoplifting
OL,12,Foffences fell last year and the charge
OL,13,Frate rose.
